Bundle-Name: Fennec OGC Features API
Bundle-Description: The protocol neutral feature access SPI of Fennec OGC Features: collection \
 descriptors derived from annotated EClasses, feature queries with a CQL2 filter and the \
 FeatureSource a backend implements.

-library: enableEMF

-buildpath: \
	org.geojson.model;version=latest,\
	net.opengis.cql2.model;version=snapshot
